    "detailed_description": "In this horror-themed comedic RPG, you are &quot;Hero&quot; (but can change your name) that tries to stop a horned-up vampire named &quot;The Grand Stroker&quot; and his electrifying friends. You will fight enemies, level up and get progressively stronger tiered gear, take on dungeons and hand-drawn bosses until the final show-down where you will fight the &quot;The Grand Stroker&quot; himself in the Grand Stroker's Castle. Will you survive --- or will he suck your life-forces dry? <br><br>The game features : <br><br>\u2022Hilarious names, places and ideas that will literally say &quot;Are you kidding me?!&quot;<br><br>\u2022Hand drawn bosses from Cesare, the legendary Italian illustrator from NecroCatic Games!!<br><br>\u2022At least 7 dungeons and a dozen bosses! Side bosses, RAID Bosses, INCARNATE Bosses and more!!<br><br>\u2022A ton of color tiered gear to collect including rare, epic and MONSTER drops!<br><br>\u2022Traditional turn-based combat with new and clearly superior <strong>Retro Sideview Combat</strong>!<br><br>\u2022Some BANGING Music by returning OST composer Scott Oakes (who did &quot;The Tower of Wowers&quot;)!! <br><br>\u2022Masterful voice actor VaughnsEvilLair providing funny and witty lines that will sure to leave you in stiches.<br><br>\u202252 Strokemon cards to collect all throughout the environment!<br><br>\u2022Ideas from the same programmer and studio that brought you such classic games as &quot;The Tower of Wowers&quot; and &quot;CarsFuckingDragons&quot;.<br><br>AND MORE!!!",
